 of their deeds.\031\03120",[286266]="Antonidas' Silver Coin\0310\03115\0310\031237282\0311\03115\031\0313\031Grant me the strength to accept the things that I cannot change, the courage to change the things I can, and the wisdom to know the difference.\031\03120",[286267]="Arcanist Doan's Silver Coin\0310\03115\0310\031237282\0311\03115\031\0313\031Oh, why won't you notice me? Abbendis, I would follow you anywhere. I wish you would notice me...\031\03120",[286268]="Fandral Staghelm's Silver Coin\0310\03115\0310\031237282\0311\03115\031\0313\031I pray that when the time comes, I will have the strength to thwart the forces beyond the gate.\031\03120",[286270]="High Tinker Mekkatorque's Silver Coin\0310\03115\0310\031237282\0311\03115\031\0313\031How does this fountain even work? I wonder if I could make one.\031\03120",[286271]="Khadgar's Silver Coin\0310\03115\0310\031237282\0311\03115\031\0313\031Turalyon and Alleria, wherever you are, may you be well.\031\03120",[286272]="King Terenas Menethil's Silver Coin\0310\03115\0310\031237282\0311\03115\031\0313\031May my son Arthas always act in the best interest of his people.\031\03120",[286273]="Maiev Shadowsong's Silver Coin\0310\03115\0310\031237282\0311\03115\031\0313\031Where's Illidan?\031\03120",[286274]="Medivh's Silver Coin\0310\03115\0310\031237282\0311\03115\031\0313\031<You sense the ringing of three tones in your head, the third barely audible under the others' din.>\031\03120",[286275]="Prince Magni Bronzebeard's Silver Coin\0310\03115\0310\031237282\0311\03115\031\0313\031I hope that my father and brothers outlive me. I'll not make much of a king.\031\03120",[286279]="Anduin Wrynn's Gold Coin\0310\03115\0310\031237281\0311\03115\031\0314\031I wish I would grow up, it feels like I've been 10 for years.\031\03120",[286280]="Uther Lightbringer's Gold Coin\0310\03115\0310\031237281\0311\03115\031\0314\031Young Arthas must learn patience to temper his power. I will pray that he one day learns how to lead with care rather than force.\031\03120",[286281]="Arthas' Gold Coin\0310\03115\0310\031237281\0311\03115\031\0314\031Already, I've a kingdom in my prospects, a land to rule. What to ask for? Perhaps a frozen scone...\031\03120",[286283]="Arugal's Gold Coin\0310\03115\0310\031237281\0311\03115\031\0314\031I wish someday to retire to my own tidy little estate, with a bunch of pet dogs to keep me company.\031\03120",[286284]="Brann Bronzebeard's Gold Coin\0310\03115\0310\031237281\0311\03115\031\0314\031Brann Bronzebeard was here.\031\03120",[286287]="Kel'Thuzad's Gold Coin\0310\03115\0310\031237281\0311\03115\031\0314\031Sometimes... I wish someone would come along and just give me a big, long hug.\031\03120",[286288]="Lady Jaina Proudmoore's Gold Coin\0310\03115\0310\031237281\0311\03115\031\0314\031Arthas, my love, please come back to me.\031\03120",[286290]="Lady Katrana Prestor's Gold Coin\0310\03115\0310\031237281\0311\03115\031\0314\031Listen, little wishing fountain. You'll give me all your power if you know what's good for you.\031\03120",[286291]="Sylvanas Windrunner's Gold Coin\0310\03115\0310\031237281\0311\03115\031\0314\031I hope my sisters and I can grow up and get married together. This coin appears to be very old.\031\03120",[286292]="Tirion Fordring's Gold Coin\0310\03115\0310\031237281\0311\03115\031\0314\031It is my wish that my dear Taelan will grow strong enough to defend the people he cares for.\031\03120",[286293]="Archimonde's Gold Coin\0310\03115\0310\031237281\0311\03115\031\0314\031I wish to know how you survived my wrath, little fountain.\031\03120",[286294]="Valdrus Blackthorne's Gold Coin\0310\03115\0310\031237281\0311\03115\031\0314\031Explain my dreams, little fountain. Why must I always be viewing my kin from above and moving them like pawns?\031\03120",[286298]="Umbrinoth's Gold Coin\0310\03115\0310\031237281\0311\03115\031\0314\031It seems my moonlighting days as a postal worker are coming to an end.\031\03120",[286299]="Thrall's Gold Coin